 "desc": "You ask. Tests are written first and locked, so the AI cannot change them. The AI builds, and the tests and separate reviewers check it, never the AI itself. A score of 70% or more passes. A riskier change is merged by you. Below 70%, the AI tries again from its best try, and after 3 tries it asks the advisor: a second AI, or you. After each task, up to 3 lessons become stricter rules for the next task.",
